[node name="DialogueTrigger" parent="." unique_id=1395628217 instance=ExtResource("6_4v5a6")]
position = Vector2(255, 151)
speakerNames = Array[String](["Narrator", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jaime", "Kiki", "Jane", "Jaime", "Narrator", "Kiki", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jane", "Kiki", "Narrator", "Jaime", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jaime", "Kiki", "Jane", "Jaime", "Jane", "Jaime", "Jane", "Kiki", "Jaime", "Jane", "Kiki"])
dialogues = Array[String](["They arrive at the library. They enter and escort Kiki to a study desk at the end of the library.", "Kiki? How do you feel? ", "Oh.. much better the library feels so… safe I love it.", "The library is the best place in the whole school. It has basically everything you need to just be happy. You got all the books you need to study, it's always so quiet and peaceful, and if anything goes wrong like a demon comes and attacks the school the library is the safehouse for any type of attack.", "Wait, demons? There's demons here?", "Not anymore, but when the school was first getting built there were demons, most of them were small and weak so they got eradicated by the sorcerers, but there was one demon that almost wiped the sorcerers out. What was it called again Jamie?", "I don't actually know. I know what you're talking about but I don't remember. Oh! There's probably a book about it here, let me check.", "Jamie gets up and checks the bookshelves nearby.", "Wait, how do you guys know about that? I never read anything like that when I was researching Vonaria. A DEMON killed almost all the sorcerers?", "The school is secretive with that because… well, Vonaria is the most elite magic school in the world so having people know that a single demon massacred them is embarrassing for them.", "What even is the demon, does the school have any labeled names for them?", "They never got to label the demons because well they did kill all of them except for one, which is the infamous demon that almost killed them all. All we know is that it's an ancient demon, that's basically it. None of the professors are allowed to teach about it, that's if they even know about it.", "How do you know all of that if they aren't allowed to teach it?", "Well one of the Professors talked about it, and that being Professor Sylvie. I'm pretty sure she's the only one that knows about the demon, but don't go asking her any questions because she already doesn't like you. So if you go and ask she will report you and get you expelled.", "Well that's dumb. ", "Yeah, you're going to have a very different experience with her than anyone she has taught. She is actually a very good teacher, but for sure a scary one for well normies.", "No really, I wouldn't have known if you didn't tell me.", "Jamie returns to the awkward tension.", "Um, are you guys good? What happened?", "Nothing Jamie. Sorry Kiki, I forgot you told me she threatened you. I was going to ask about what happened, but I got distracted with the whole demon thing. I'm sorry.", "It's okay.. don’t worry. I'm still a little shaken up by it. Like I get, I'm not the average Vonaria student, and I don't have a magical aura around me, but to hate normies so much that you go out of your way to ruin their life is just insane. Normal humans aren’t anything special, they're just normal. I don't get it.", "What did she tell you?", "She told me that I don’t belong here… even IF I can use magic, she said that I’m nothing and will never amount to anything… she said she’ll do whatever she can to ruin my… love for magic. I… I just don't get it… why do so much on someone who can't defend themselves.", "Oh Kiki, I'm so sorry. Hey, look at me. Listen, she is wrong and stupid if she thinks she can get away with that.", "Um actually she technically can get away with that. The higher ups aren't gonna do anything if you report the professor for that.", "Jamie, you aren't helping.", "Oh, sorry, I’ll uh, I’ll just be here.", "Kiki listen you are special, like actually special, you are a normie that can use magic if you play your cards right you can get away with so much. You have so much potential that only the four of us can see, so don't worry about what the professor or the five of those dumb bitches have to say or do. All you have to do is just continue going on and study and do what you came here for.", "You’re right Jane, I will do that, I.. Can do this.. I can do this, I will do this!", "Damn right you can! and we will be there to help you. If those bitches come after you, fight them, they may be good fighters but make them miss and embarrass themselves and you will be fine. ", "No, don't do that! You've got potential, but to fight the five of them you're gonna get cooked. Just avoid them and find us as fast as you can, Jaime and I rival most of them so we can help fend them off. For the Professor best to avoid interacting with her if she tries anything the best you can do is hide in the restrooms, sorcerers aren't allowed in the students restrooms. Either way, we will defend you. We got you Kiki.", "Thank you guys, I know I can count on you."])
